Install:
    tested on python=3.10, CUDA=12.1, pytorch=2.6

    pip install torch=2.6 torchvision=0.21 torchaudio=2.6
    pip install -re requirements.txt
    pip install -e .


Inference:
    python HRI_mllm/scripts/test.py


